# Normalize line endings to LF for everything text -- this Windows dev machine
# has flipped the Makefile to CRLF before (breaks recipe tabs, see CLAUDE.md),
# and the same risk applies to any shell/YAML file. Binary artifacts (parquet,
# duckdb, images) are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

Makefile text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.R text eol=lf

*.parquet binary
*.duckdb binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
